、もっと効率よくやろうよー」\n「あたしは親友さえ守れればいくらでも殺せるよ？」\n「にしし、大丈夫、大丈夫！あたしには秘策がある！」\n\nシチュ：グレーテルに出てきたような魔物が常世に迫る。しかし、常世は余裕の表情。\n背中から巨大な蜘蛛の脚を生やし、周りには大百足をはじめとする巨大な虫を侍らせ、\n「さぁ、やろうか？」という感じでニヤリと笑みを浮かべる感じでお願いします！\nできれば複数ページで…💦\n\n神谷ユウさんの漫画、どれも素晴らしく、今も単行本やwebで見ています！\n素晴らしい漫画をこれからも楽しみにしています！\n宜しくお願いいたします！🙇\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/111415679", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1043109, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "イャクヮン", "screen_name": "YAKAN4771", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1613814794372648961/qihhRIoL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/836714305/1726591600/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 1161702, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "竹内黙", "screen_name": "oh_2s", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1571157776663216130/g1uxXEI6.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 2843235, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "名無し", "screen_name": "trorpy", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2009281019204259845/xUmLsDbs.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1582960140247912450/1767884900/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_ra